Features: Validation of Location APIs

Scenario Outline: Validate the location details is being added successfully using AddPlaceAPI

Given Add place playload with "<name>" "<language>"  "<address>"
when Users call "AddPlaceAPI" with "Post" https request
Then the API call got success with status code is "200"
And "status" in response body is "OK"
And "scope" in response body is "APP"
And Verify place_Id created maps to "<name>" using "getPlaceAPI"

Examples:
|name     |language     |address|
|Xeng     |Chinese      |Beijing|
|Ashok    |Hindi        |Delhi  |
|John     |English      |Miami  |